{"matched":43,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0382c01","n":"0382c","t":"一切佛語心品第二之下此下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0383c01","n":"0383c","t":"想即名聲聞種性即彼五蘊了"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0384a01","n":"0384a","t":"之而起三乘聖性以非無故因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0384b01","n":"0384b","t":"一切想下破有無見記曰此明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0384c01","n":"0384c","t":"幻師幻作諸男女雖見諸根動"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0385b01","n":"0385b","t":"愚所知故云非愚夫現是故我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0386c01","n":"0386c","t":"形為字形聲相稱為文記曰字"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0387a01","n":"0387a","t":"指耳豈期愚夫復執言說生種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0387b01","n":"0387b","t":"問我弟子云世尊亦說此法否"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0387c01","n":"0387c","t":"然無記者以無可記錄故蓋外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0388a01","n":"0388a","t":"說或時反詰或時廣為分別如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0388b01","n":"0388b","t":"妄執諸法一定有能生我但以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0388c01","n":"0388c","t":"所以一切法離自性故故說諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0389b01","n":"0389b","t":"止論魏唐二譯皆云置答記曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0390a01","n":"0390a","t":"一來欲界方得斷除後三品殘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0390b01","n":"0390b","t":"故歷生不同故三生五生而般"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0390c01","n":"0390c","t":"記曰此總示斷結得果之相也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0391a01","n":"0391a","t":"須陀洹妄想身見彼以人無我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0391b01","n":"0391b","t":"是名斷身見相記曰此釋斷疑"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0392a01","n":"0392a","t":"空觀智頓照五蘊生相不起心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0392b01","n":"0392b","t":"皆悉成就至於煩惱發業所招"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0392c01","n":"0392c","t":"依妄想處種種說法故法非真"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0393a01","n":"0393a","t":"如煑沙欲成嘉饌縱經塵劫終"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0393b01","n":"0393b","t":"分別執著建立智然法非有無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0393c01","n":"0393c","t":"記曰此明外道邪智也然彼外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0394a01","n":"0394a","t":"百劫事九能以智慧入百法明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0394c01","n":"0394c","t":"責問之詞也然我但說四大從"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0395a01","n":"0395a","t":"執有九法謂五大時方和合此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0396c01","n":"0396c","t":"記曰此辯果德不同初示邪果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0397a01","n":"0397a","t":"自共相相續流注斷涅槃者謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0397b01","n":"0397b","t":"盡是涅槃不必別求以當體無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0397c01","n":"0397c","t":"妄見此影執為我我所者乃名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0398a01","n":"0398a","t":"計涅槃實有自性及有所作相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0398b01","n":"0398b","t":"總歸如如以顯一乘平等因果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0398c01","n":"0398c","t":"計著生乃名也事自性相計著"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0399b01","n":"0399b","t":"極無形而妄見有生此無而有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0400a01","n":"0400a","t":"記曰此結示真妄平等相也謂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0400b01","n":"0400b","t":"故且彼緣起諸法非妄想也何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0401b01","n":"0401b","t":"法爾歸性以隨緣時似有顯現"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0402a01","n":"0402a","t":"本自如如此所以為一乘平等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0402b01","n":"0402b","t":"曰前聖所知者但妄想無性耳"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0402c01","n":"0402c","t":"乘者以有待而然非絕然也然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-4_p0403a01","n":"0403a","t":"何也所謂菩提心生生滅心滅"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-X-X17n0326-觀楞伽經記保字版卷4","source":"CBETA X17n0326-4 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":64,"unit":"X17 頁欄"}